     mat_peptide     5423..7471
                     /locus_tag="PestiV1gp1"
                     /product="NTPase/RNA helicase"
                     /note="characteristic of cytopathogenic strains. This
                     protein is produced from NS2-3 as a result of various
                     recombination events involving cellular sequences (e.g.
                     ubiquitin) or a few point mutations in the strain Oregon.
                     The cleavage of BVDV NCP7 (non-pathogenic strain) NS2-3 was
                     promoted by the interaction of NS2 (suspected to be a
                     non-canonical proteinase) with cellular J-domain protein
                     Jiv (whose sequence fragment was identified in pathogenic
                     BVDV NADL); nonstructural protein NS3; serine proteinase"
                     /protein_id="NP_776267.1"
